  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  version: \"0.4.101\"\n\npackage:\n  name: flyctl\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/superfly/flyctl/archive/refs/tags/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: 55fac27166b8be47309a6e5980671f367c787a1ae1eefa2c6515c6ffe668628b\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  script:\n    interpreter: nu\n    content:\n      - let prefix = $env.LIBRARY_PREFIX? | default $env.PREFIX\n      # build main app and generate license data\n      - let build_time = date now | format date \"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\"\n      - let short_commit_hash = (http get https://api.github.com/repos/superfly/flyctl/commits/v${{ version }}).sha | str substring 0..6\n      - go build\n        -o=($prefix)/bin/\n        -v\n        -ldflags=$'-s -w -X github.com/superfly/flyctl/internal/buildinfo.buildVersion=${{ version }} -X github.com/superfly/flyctl/internal/buildinfo.buildDate=($build_time) -X github.com/superfly/flyctl/internal/buildinfo.commit=($short_commit_hash)'\n        -trimpath\n        -tags production\n        .\n      - go-licenses save .\n        --save_path=library_licenses\n        --ignore=github.com/in-toto/attestation/go/v1\n        --ignore=github.com/in-toto/in-toto-golang\n        --ignore=github.com/jmespath/go-jmespath\n        --ignore=github.com/launchdarkly/go-jsonstream/v3\n        --ignore=github.com/launchdarkly/go-sdk-common/v3\n      # generate shell completions\n      - if: build_platform == host_platform\n        then:\n          - mkdir ($prefix)/share/bash-completion/completions ($prefix)/share/fish/vendor_completions.d ($prefix)/share/zsh/site-functions\n          - let bin = ($prefix)/bin/flyctl\n          - ^$bin completion bash | save ($prefix)/share/bash-completion/completions/flyctl\n          - ^$bin completion fish | save ($prefix)/share/fish/vendor_completions.d/flyctl.fish\n          - ^$bin completion zsh  | save ($prefix)/share/zsh/site-functions/_flyctl\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler(\"go-nocgo\") }}\n    - go-licenses\n    - nushell\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - flyctl help\n      - flyctl version\n  - package_contents:\n      bin:\n        - flyctl\n      files:\n        - if: unix and build_platform == host_platform\n          then:\n            - share/bash-completion/completions/flyctl\n            - share/fish/vendor_completions.d/flyctl.fish\n            - share/zsh/site-functions/_flyctl\n        - if: win and build_platform == host_platform\n          then:\n            - Library/share/bash-completion/completions/flyctl\n            - Library/share/fish/vendor_completions.d/flyctl.fish\n            - Library/share/zsh/site-functions/_flyctl\n      strict: true\n\nabout:\n  summary: CLI for deploying and managing applications on fly.io\n  description: |\n    flyctl is the command-line interface for the fly.io platform for\n    deploying and running applications on scalable hardware-isolated sandboxes.\n    Use flyctl to launch apps, manage deployments, scale machines, handle\n    secrets, configure networking, and more.\n  license: Apache-2.0\n  license_file:\n    - LICENSE\n    - library_licenses/\n  homepage: https://fly.io\n  repository: https://github.com/superfly/flyctl\n  documentation: https://fly.io/docs/flyctl/\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - salim-b\n",
